# Generated outputs are TRACKED: the documents and reports under output/ are the
# evidence for the claims in the manuscript, so a reader must be able to fetch the
# repository and inspect the artefacts rather than take the numbers on trust.
# Only genuinely disposable intermediates are ignored.
output/roundtrip/
output/data/

